msgstr ""
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Language: zh_Hans\n"

msgid "AutoPlay"
msgstr "AutoPlay"

msgid "CarPlay in the Tesla's web browser. The box's Wi-Fi (Network → Wireless) is handed to the iPhone over Bluetooth; the Tesla joins the same Wi-Fi and opens the CarPlay page."
msgstr "在特斯拉的浏览器里用 CarPlay。盒子的 Wi-Fi（「网络 → 无线」）经蓝牙交给 iPhone；特斯拉连同一个 Wi-Fi 打开 CarPlay 画面。"

msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概览"

msgid "Status"
msgstr "状态"

msgid "Running"
msgstr "运行中"

msgid "Not running"
msgstr "未运行"

msgid "Network warning"
msgstr "网络提示"

msgid "Open"
msgstr "打开"

msgid "Add iPhone"
msgstr "添加 iPhone"

msgid "CarPlay screen"
msgstr "CarPlay 画面"

msgid "Network"
msgstr "网络"

msgid "iPhone"
msgstr "iPhone"

msgid "Own address"
msgstr "自己的网址"

msgid "Program update"
msgstr "程序更新"

msgid "Enable"
msgstr "启用"

msgid "Addresses"
msgstr "地址"

msgid "The box's LAN is %s (set at install: a Tesla's browser opens no private address). The first access point under Network → Wireless is handed to the iPhone, 5 GHz first; the Tesla sees 5 GHz channels 36–48 and 149–165 only (CN: 149). In the Tesla's Wi-Fi settings turn on \"Remain connected in Drive\", else the picture stops out of Park. Settings page: %s"
msgstr "盒子的局域网是 %s（安装时设定：特斯拉的浏览器打不开私有地址）。「网络 → 无线」里的第一个热点交给 iPhone，优先 5 GHz；特斯拉只认 5 GHz 的 36–48 和 149–165 信道（国内用 149）。在特斯拉的 Wi-Fi 设置里打开「行驶中保持连接」，否则出 P 挡画面会停。设置页：%s"

msgid "CarPlay screen port"
msgstr "CarPlay 画面端口"

msgid "The HTTPS port of the CarPlay page. Empty is 18443, or the port an older install saved; a change takes about a minute and interrupts CarPlay briefly. It must differ from 18080, 80, 443 and 7000."
msgstr "CarPlay 画面的 HTTPS 端口。留空为 18443，或旧版保存过的端口；修改约 1 分钟生效，CarPlay 会短暂中断。不能与 18080、80、443、7000 相同。"

msgid "Diagnostics"
msgstr "诊断"

msgid "Download diagnostics from the AutoPlay settings page. Saving changes here restarts the service and interrupts CarPlay briefly."
msgstr "诊断记录在 AutoPlay 设置页下载。在这里保存修改会重启服务，CarPlay 会短暂中断。"

msgid "Adding an iPhone"
msgstr "添加 iPhone"

msgid "Open the settings page on the Tesla or another device (not on the iPhone being added: it must stay in Settings → Bluetooth) and tap \"Add iPhone\". Pair the iPhone with the Tesla over Bluetooth as well and pick it as the media source: music, navigation prompts, calls and Siri all play over the car's own Bluetooth; the CarPlay page only shows the screen."
msgstr "在特斯拉或另一台设备上打开设置页（不要在要添加的那部 iPhone 上：它要停在「设置 → 蓝牙」），点「添加 iPhone」。iPhone 也要用蓝牙连上特斯拉并选为媒体来源：音乐、导航播报、通话和 Siri 都从车机蓝牙播出；CarPlay 页面只显示画面。"

msgid "Release the iPhone after (seconds)"
msgstr "无人观看多久后释放 iPhone（秒）"

msgid "Without any page showing the picture for this long, wireless CarPlay ends and the iPhone stops sending its screen; opening the page invites it again (about 7 s). 0: never end it."
msgstr "没有任何网页在看画面超过这个时间，就结束无线 CarPlay，iPhone 不再持续发送画面、不会发热；之后打开网页会重新邀请（约 7 秒出画面）。填 0 表示永不结束。"

msgid "DuckDNS sub-domain"
msgstr "DuckDNS 子域名"

msgid "Sign up for free at duckdns.org, add a sub-domain and enter it with the token shown there. The name becomes that name (e.g. mycar.duckdns.org): AutoPlay points it at this box and obtains a free Let's Encrypt certificate, renewed automatically over the SIM, so the Tesla opens https://mycar.duckdns.org:18443/ without a warning."
msgstr "在 duckdns.org 免费注册，添加一个子域名，把它和页面上显示的 token 填在这里。域名就是那个名字（例如 mycar.duckdns.org）：AutoPlay 把它指向这台盒子并申请免费的 Let's Encrypt 证书，经 SIM 卡自动续期，特斯拉打开 https://mycar.duckdns.org:18443/ 不会有警告。"

msgid "DuckDNS token"
msgstr "DuckDNS token"

msgid "DNS provider"
msgstr "DNS 服务商"

msgid "DuckDNS"
msgstr "DuckDNS"

msgid "Tencent Cloud (DNSPod)"
msgstr "腾讯云（DNSPod）"

msgid "Which DNS service owns the name below. Without any name the Tesla opens https://autoplay.lan:18443/ with the box's own certificate; whether its warning page offers \"continue\" is not verified."
msgstr "下面这个域名由哪家 DNS 服务商管理。不填域名时，特斯拉打开 https://autoplay.lan:18443/ 用的是盒子自己的证书；它的警告页是否提供「继续」尚未验证。"

msgid "Own domain (DNSPod)"
msgstr "自己的域名（DNSPod）"

msgid "A full domain you manage in Tencent Cloud DNS (DNSPod), e.g. car.example.com. AutoPlay obtains the Let's Encrypt certificate with a DNS-01 challenge through the DNSPod API and answers the name locally for the Tesla; also add an A record for it pointing at 100.96.0.1 in the DNSPod console, so the name resolves through a public resolver too. The Tesla opens https://car.example.com:18443/ without a warning."
msgstr "你在腾讯云 DNS（DNSPod）里管理的完整域名，例如 car.example.com。AutoPlay 通过 DNSPod API 完成 DNS-01 验证申请 Let's Encrypt 证书，并在本地为特斯拉解析这个域名；建议同时在 DNSPod 控制台加一条指向 100.96.0.1 的 A 记录。特斯拉打开 https://car.example.com:18443/ 不会有警告。"

msgid "DNSPod API ID"
msgstr "DNSPod API ID"

msgid "In the DNSPod console (console.dnspod.cn) → Security settings → API Token → create a token; the ID is the number shown there."
msgstr "在 DNSPod 控制台（console.dnspod.cn）→ 安全设置 → API Token → 创建一个 Token；ID 就是那里显示的数字。这个 Token 能改整个账号的解析记录，只填在自己掌控的盒子上。"

msgid "DNSPod API token"
msgstr "DNSPod API Token"

msgid "Certificate"
msgstr "证书"

msgid "Loading…"
msgstr "正在读取…"

msgid "Check for a new version daily"
msgstr "每天检查新版本"

msgid "Only shows that there is one; nothing is installed until you click \"Update now\". Before updating, the iPhones, certificates and settings are backed up; a version that does not start is replaced by the previous one."
msgstr "只提示有新版本，点「立即升级」才会安装。升级前会备份 iPhone、证书和设置；新版本起不来会自动退回原来的版本。"

msgid "Download mirror"
msgstr "下载镜像"

msgid "Tried when GitHub cannot be reached. Releases are signed, so a mirror cannot change what is installed. Empty: the built-in mirror; \"none\": GitHub only."
msgstr "连不上 GitHub 时改用这个地址前缀下载。发布带签名，镜像改不了装进来的内容。留空用内置的镜像；填 none 只用 GitHub。"

msgid "Network check unavailable (service starting or stopped)."
msgstr "网络检查暂不可用（服务启动中或已停止）。"

msgid "No own name set."
msgstr "没有设置自己的网址。"

msgid "certificate installed"
msgstr "证书已装好"

msgid "obtaining the certificate (a few minutes online)"
msgstr "正在申请证书（联网后几分钟）"

msgid "renewing the certificate"
msgstr "正在续签证书"

msgid "not obtained yet: check the SIM and the DNS provider credentials; retried every hour"
msgstr "还没申请到：检查 SIM 卡、域名和 DNS 服务商的凭证；每小时重试"

msgid "waiting for the internet"
msgstr "等待联网"

msgid "DNS record update failed, retrying"
msgstr "更新域名解析失败，继续重试"

msgid "Updating:"
msgstr "正在升级："

msgid "About 2–5 minutes; CarPlay is interrupted meanwhile."
msgstr "约 2–5 分钟，期间 CarPlay 会断开。"

msgid "Last update:"
msgstr "上次升级："

msgid "Last update did not finish:"
msgstr "上次升级没有完成："

msgid "Checking for updates failed:"
msgstr "检查更新没有成功："

msgid "New version %s"
msgstr "有新版本 %s"

msgid "(installed: %s)"
msgstr "（当前 %s）"

msgid "an older version"
msgstr "较旧版本"

msgid "This version changes the system: reinstall as the installation guide describes."
msgstr "这一版改了系统：请按装机说明重新安装。"

msgid "Up to date:"
msgstr "已是最新："

msgid "Check now"
msgstr "立即检查"

msgid "Update AutoPlay now? CarPlay is interrupted for a few minutes."
msgstr "现在升级 AutoPlay？CarPlay 会断开几分钟。"

msgid "Update now"
msgstr "立即升级"

msgid "Last checked: %s"
msgstr "上次检查：%s"
